status=EVIDENCE / zero-edge singleton geometry atlas; not an LRC14 proof
source=HYP-3476 pair-current split + HYP-3477 hard discharge + S319 unit-delta split

## Assumption Challenge
alternate vertices considered: runners, gaps, fixed circle sections,
section boundaries, wall-crossing events, residues, cover arcs,
dead-cover projection nodes, singleton dead components, mirror component
pairs, owner pairs, E/branch gates, and terminal proof obligations.
chosen carrier vertices: zero-edge singleton dead pockets and their
mirror/owner/gate-touch sidecars.
preserved predicate: the six small-touch/no-hard rows have isolated
dead-cover pockets requiring singleton-current terminal discharge.
destroyed by scalarization: exact interval location, mirror partner,
owner-pair residue/span, S319 gate-kind class, and complete gate touches.

